Plain text and source code
description: text/plain verbatim, with an encoding control; known source languages highlighted
- >
  A `text/plain` file renders verbatim at reading width, with an encoding selector for files
  that are not UTF-8.
- >
  Source files of the data languages yamlover itself speaks - `.yo`, JSON, JSON5, JSON5P,
  YAML - get the same plain reading surface plus syntax highlighting from the shared lexer.
